{"3602430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Night Shift", "steam_appid": 3602430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/6ec7e4dd1666e7194d5fc13039fb4156.avif?t=1774489405\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations on your new job! You’ve been selected for the <i>Night Shift</i> at the finest pizza establishment this side of the void. Your duties are simple: sweep up, hand out pizzas, rearrange the chairs, and keep an eye on—well, never mind that part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s just three nights. Just you, the pizza, and whatever that was in the corner of your eye. If you survive, you get paid. If you don’t… hey, you won’t be hungry anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/327a93243421e6a2ecec5f6db75fcb58.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/327a93243421e6a2ecec5f6db75fcb58.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/327a93243421e6a2ecec5f6db75fcb58.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of lo-fi horror, <i>Night Shift</i> blends first-person survival mechanics with PS1-era visuals, atmospheric tension, and a dash of pizza grease. Tasks are randomly assigned each night, so stay sharp. Or don’t. It’s your funeral.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/de3d9102265f7b1abaefbcd70d6debd8.avif?t=1774489405\" width=616 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand out pizza to the night delivery crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out the trash before something else does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the chairs up on the tables. You’ll want a clear line of sight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/108a660a6a5a9814528e82f929056877.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/108a660a6a5a9814528e82f929056877.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/108a660a6a5a9814528e82f929056877.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/4b27541b2664c91c815fb0473edf145e.avif?t=1774489405\" width=616 height=85 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍕 <i>Three-night survival horror experience</i> in a haunted pizza parlor with a twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪑 <i>Interactive task system</i> — clean up, organize, deliver. No two shifts are exactly alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <i>Retro PS1-style visuals</i> and analog horror vibes straight from your favorite nightmares.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/45cb847e547d8ca80e6f435211d5f574.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/45cb847e547d8ca80e6f435211d5f574.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/45cb847e547d8ca80e6f435211d5f574.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <i>First-person perspective</i> keeps you close to the action—and everything else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <i>Minimal guidance, maximum paranoia.</i> Figure it out. Quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📻 <i>Atmospheric sound design</i> that may or may not be whispering to you.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/dee8494f28cf7bdcd02a7999cd3a9194.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/dee8494f28cf7bdcd02a7999cd3a9194.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/dee8494f28cf7bdcd02a7999cd3a9194.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wanted a job? You got one. Now hang in there. Don’t look too long at anything you can’t explain. And above all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happy shift!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/6ec7e4dd1666e7194d5fc13039fb4156.avif?t=1774489405\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations on your new job! You’ve been selected for the <i>Night Shift</i> at the finest pizza establishment this side of the void. Your duties are simple: sweep up, hand out pizzas, rearrange the chairs, and keep an eye on—well, never mind that part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.poster.avif?t=1774489405\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.webm?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602430/extras/311b97bf8f773dd451e6608c0b36f920.mp4?t=1774489405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s just three nights. Just you, the pizza, and whatever that was in the corner of your eye. If you survive, you get paid. If you don’t… hey, you won’t be hungry anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 